{"seq":2,"slug":"container-move-lifecycle-status-model","title":"箱流生命周期与搬移状态模型：从进口放箱到空箱回场的可追踪状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/port-drayage-truck-appointment-container-dispatch-system/drayage-network-operating-model/container-move-lifecycle-status-model","wordCount":2830,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"箱流生命周期与搬移状态模型-从进口放箱到空箱回场的可追踪状态机\">箱流生命周期与搬移状态模型：从进口放箱到空箱回场的可追踪状态机</h1><p>一条挂在码头堆场的进口重箱，在 TMS 里可能同时存在三种互相矛盾的&quot;状态&quot;：码头系统说它还是 <code>IN_YARD</code>，船公司平台说它已被 <code>GATE_OUT</code>，车队司机 App 说它刚被装上拖架。三种说法都不算错——它们描述的是<strong>同一次搬移在不同主体账本上的投影</strong>。集卡短驳系统的大部分工程复杂度不是搬运本身，而是把一组异步、可能乱序到达的状态信号收敛成一个可对账、可计费、可追责的箱流状态机。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-设备状态与交易状态的双轨模型\">核心概念：设备状态与交易状态的双轨模型</h2><p>箱流生命周期必须拆成两条<strong>互相耦合但各自演进</strong>的轨道，否则状态永远对不齐：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><strong>设备轨（equipment track）</strong>——物理箱体在哪里、归谁管、能不能动。身份锚点是箱号，格式由 ISO 6346 定义：4 个字母（前 3 位为箱主代码，第 4 位为设备类别 <code>U</code>/<code>J</code>/<code>Z</code>）+ 6 位序号 + 1 位模 11 校验码 <a href=\"https://www.iso.org/standard/79888.html\">ISO 6346:2022, <em>Freight containers — Coding, identification and marking</em></a>。录入时必须当场验这一位——校验码错一位，后面所有状态都会挂到一个不存在的箱体上。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>交易轨（transaction track）</strong>——这一票货的商务生命周期：谁下的提箱指令、自由期何时到期、是否已还空、产生多少滞箱费。身份锚点是<strong>提单号 / 订舱号 / 放箱单号（Delivery Order）</strong>，与箱号是多对一关系（一个订舱可用多个箱）。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两轨耦合成一张状态机。下图给出从船舶卸箱到空箱归场的主干路径与关键跃迁条件：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;船舶卸箱 DISC&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;是否已&lt;br/&gt;清关放行?&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;否 卡在海关&quot;| B2[&quot;HOLD_CUSTOMS&lt;br/&gt;不可提箱&quot;] --&gt; B&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| C[&quot;AVAILABLE&lt;br/&gt;可提箱时点 T_avail&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D{&quot;自由期&lt;br/&gt;是否到期?&quot;}&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;未到期&quot;| E[&quot;提箱指令 DO&lt;br/&gt;预约提箱&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;已到期&quot;| D2[&quot;DEMURRAGE&lt;br/&gt;按日计费&quot;] --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;GATE_OUT 重箱出场&lt;br/&gt;EIR 生成&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;IN_TRANSIT 在途&lt;br/&gt;交付收货人&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; H[&quot;EMPTY 掏箱完成&lt;br/&gt;箱体清空&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; I{&quot;还箱地&lt;br/&gt;是否接受?&quot;}&#10;  I --&gt;|&quot;接受&quot;| J[&quot;GATE_IN 空箱回场&lt;br/&gt;设备轨终态&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt;|&quot;不接受 错过窗口&quot;| I2[&quot;DETENTION&lt;br/&gt;按日计费&quot;] --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"船舶卸箱 DISC\"] --&gt; B{\"是否已&lt;br/&gt;清关放行?\"}\n  B --&gt;|\"否 卡在海关\"| B2[\"HOLD_CUSTOMS&lt;br/&gt;不可提箱\"] --&gt; B\n  B --&gt;|\"是\"| C[\"AVAILABLE&lt;br/&gt;可提箱时点 T_avail\"]\n  C --&gt; D{\"自由期&lt;br/&gt;是否到期?\"}\n  D --&gt;|\"未到期\"| E[\"提箱指令 DO&lt;br/&gt;预约提箱\"]\n  D --&gt;|\"已到期\"| D2[\"DEMURRAGE&lt;br/&gt;按日计费\"] --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[\"GATE_OUT 重箱出场&lt;br/&gt;EIR 生成\"]\n  F --&gt; G[\"IN_TRANSIT 在途&lt;br/&gt;交付收货人\"]\n  G --&gt; H[\"EMPTY 掏箱完成&lt;br/&gt;箱体清空\"]\n  H --&gt; I{\"还箱地&lt;br/&gt;是否接受?\"}\n  I --&gt;|\"接受\"| J[\"GATE_IN 空箱回场&lt;br/&gt;设备轨终态\"]\n  I --&gt;|\"不接受 错过窗口\"| I2[\"DETENTION&lt;br/&gt;按日计费\"] --&gt; I</pre><p>这张图里有三个容易被工程实现忽略的要点：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><code>AVAILABLE</code> 不是一个事件，而是一个时点</strong>。它是&quot;卸箱完成时间&quot;与&quot;清关放行时间&quot;的<strong>较晚者</strong>，必须由系统运行时求值，而非从上游消息里直接取。</li>\n<li><strong>滞期费（demurrage）与滞箱费（detention）是两条独立的计时轨</strong>。前者从 <code>AVAILABLE</code> 到 <code>GATE_OUT</code>，管箱子压在<strong>码头</strong>里；后者从 <code>GATE_OUT</code> 到空箱 <code>GATE_IN</code>，管箱子压在<strong>收货人/车队</strong>手里。美国联邦海事委员会（FMC）2020 年的《滞期费与滞箱费解释性规则》要求两者都服务于&quot;激励货物流动&quot;，且<strong>账单必须携带足够的可核验信息</strong>（哪些箱、免费期如何起算、为什么收费）<a href=\"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2020/05/18/2020-09370/interpretive-rule-on-demurrage-and-detention-under-the-shipping-act\">FMC, <em>Interpretive Rule on Demurrage and Detention</em>, 46 CFR Part 545</a>。因此状态机不能只存一个&quot;是否超期&quot;的布尔值，必须保留<strong>起算事件、起算时间、免费天数、日历规则</strong>四项证据。</li>\n<li><strong>终态是&quot;空箱归场&quot;而非&quot;货物签收&quot;</strong>——货交完了但空箱没还，交易轨没闭合，滞箱费仍在累积。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"状态词汇的标准映射-从-edi-到-dcsa-事件模型\">状态词汇的标准映射：从 EDI 到 DCSA 事件模型</h2><p>上游状态信号来自四个互不相同的世界，其粒度差异正是集成时最常见的语义错配来源：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>词汇体系</th>\n<th>典型载体</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>集成陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ISO 6346</td>\n<td>箱体标识</td>\n<td>设备身份</td>\n<td>只保证&quot;这是哪个箱&quot;，不含任何状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ANSI X12 214 / 315</td>\n<td>EDI 报文</td>\n<td>运输事件</td>\n<td>214 状态码语义依承运人而异，同一码值可能被两家船司用于不同阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UN/EDIFACT COARRI / CODECO</td>\n<td>EDI 报文</td>\n<td>码头作业报告</td>\n<td>时间戳常为作业完成时间，非事件发生时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DCSA Track &amp; Trace</td>\n<td>REST/JSON API</td>\n<td>统一事件模型</td>\n<td>枚举（<code>GTIN</code> 进闸、<code>GTOT</code> 出闸、<code>DISC</code> 卸船）需与内部状态映射</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>码头侧</strong>用 UN/EDIFACT 作业报告：<code>CODECO</code> 承载进出闸口记录，<code>COARRI</code> 承载装卸船记录，<code>COPRAR</code> 是装卸指令。它们把<strong>作业完成时间</strong>当作事件时间——码头在吊具松钩、闸口读完 EIR 之后才发消息，固有延迟从分钟到小时不等。</p>\n<p><strong>船公司侧</strong>传统走 ANSI X12：<code>214</code> 承载陆运里程碑状态码，<code>315</code> 承载海运状态详情。<code>214</code> 的状态码是<strong>承运人自定义语义与 X12 标准码的混合体</strong>——同一票货两家船司可能用不同码值表达&quot;已放箱&quot;，因此绝不能硬编码进跃迁表。</p>\n<p><strong>行业统一侧</strong>是 DCSA（Digital Container Shipping Association）的 Track &amp; Trace 标准，把 9 家主要船公司的事件模型统一成一套 REST API，按 <code>EQUIPMENT</code> / <code>TRANSPORTATION</code> / <code>SHIPMENT</code> 三个域组织，设备域用 <code>GTIN</code>（进闸）、<code>GTOT</code>（出闸）、<code>DISC</code>（卸船）等枚举 <a href=\"https://dcsa.org/standards/track-and-trace/\">DCSA, <em>Track &amp; Trace Standard v2</em></a>。现实中<strong>新旧并存</strong>：大型 BCO 已买 DCSA 事件流，中小车队仍在解析 214。</p>\n<p><strong>监管侧</strong>是第四条信号线：FMC 滞期/滞箱规则、海关放行状态都会决定状态机能否前进——清关未放行的箱子即使堆场已就绪也不能进入 <code>AVAILABLE</code>。</p>\n<p>归一后内部状态集应<strong>刻意收窄</strong>，不照搬上游上百个码值。可用的最小心智是 8 个状态：<code>DISCHARGED</code>、<code>HELD</code>、<code>AVAILABLE</code>、<code>APPOINTMENT_BOOKED</code>、<code>GATE_OUT</code>、<code>DELIVERED</code>、<code>EMPTY</code>、<code>RETURNED</code>，外加两个计费标记 <code>DEMURRAGE_ACTIVE</code> / <code>DETENTION_ACTIVE</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"进口放箱到可提箱-自由期与时点的计算\">进口放箱到可提箱：自由期与时点的计算</h2><p><code>AVAILABLE</code> 的求值是状态机的第一个真实计算，而非字段拷贝。设卸箱完成时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>disc</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{disc}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">disc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，清关放行时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>rel</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{rel}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<strong>最后免费日（Last Free Day, LFD）</strong> 由免费期天数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>free</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{free}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">free</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与日历规则决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>avail</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>disc</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>rel</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>LFD</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>avail</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>free</mtext></msub><mtext> （按营业日历顺延）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{avail}} = \\max\\!\\left(T_{\\text{disc}},\\ T_{\\text{rel}}\\right),\\qquad \\text{LFD} = T_{\\text{avail}} + d_{\\text{free}}\\ \\text{（按营业日历顺延）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">avail</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">disc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LFD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">avail</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">free</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（按营业日历顺延）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>免费期通常<strong>排除周末与法定节假日</strong>，且不同承运人、航线、协议客户的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>free</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{free}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">free</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从 3 天到 7 天不等。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>free</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{free}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">free</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与日历规则必须是<strong>装箱维度上的配置实体</strong>而非常量：同一批到港的箱子因所属船司不同，LFD 可能相差数天。</p>\n<p>越过 LFD 后滞期费按日累进，常见阶梯费率（前若干天一个价、之后翻档）可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>dem</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{dem}} = \\sum_{k=1}^{N} r_{\\lceil k/b \\rceil}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dem</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3364em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是超期天数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是每档天数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 档日费率（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>⋯</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_1 &lt; r_2 &lt; \\cdots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.313em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span></span></span></span></span>）。关键约束是<strong>计费由状态事件驱动且可重放</strong>：重跑一次对账不应算出与昨天不同的金额。费率来自码头收费表（terminal tariff）并随年度调整，因此必须是<strong>带生效日期的版本化数据</strong>，账单要能引用&quot;当时生效&quot;的那一版。</p>\n<p><code>AVAILABLE</code> 之后是提箱指令：船公司或货代签发的放箱单（Delivery Order, DO）通常与 LFD 绑定，DO 未放而预约已订是码头预约里最常见的&quot;空预约&quot;成因，因此 <code>APPOINTMENT_BOOKED</code> 必须与 DO 释放状态做<strong>前置校验</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重箱交付与空箱回场-双重运输与还箱约束\">重箱交付与空箱回场：双重运输与还箱约束</h2><p><code>GATE_OUT</code> 是设备轨与交易轨的分叉点：设备轨进入在途，EIR（Equipment Interchange Receipt）生成——这是箱体责任从码头转给车队的法律凭证，记录箱况、封条号、拖架号；交易轨的滞期费时钟停止、滞箱费时钟启动。</p>\n<p>交付收货人、掏箱完成后箱体变空，进入 <code>EMPTY</code>。此时系统面对<strong>双重运输（dual transaction / street turn）<strong>这一核心优化点：进口掏空的箱子若恰好有出口订舱需要同类型空箱，可直接从收货人处拉去出口码头装货，<strong>跳过&quot;空箱先回场、再提出来&quot;两段空驶</strong>。它在状态机上不是新增状态，而是</strong>把还空与下一次提箱合并成一个事件</strong>——空箱从未真正落到还箱堆场。实现必须允许这条&quot;短路跃迁&quot;，并记录它节省了哪两段里程。</p>\n<p>双重运输受两条硬约束。其一，<strong>箱型与箱主匹配</strong>：进口箱属承运人 A，出口订舱走承运人 B 的舱位时 A 的箱通常不能用于 B 的出口（除非两司有互用协议），因此&quot;设备归属&quot;必须是跃迁守卫条件而非只看箱型。其二，<strong>还箱地点的双边一致</strong>：还箱地由船公司在还箱窗口内的接受规则决定，某些码头在特定时段只接受特定尺寸或关闭还箱；错过窗口的空箱只能拖到更远的堆场，或压在车队手里累积滞箱费。</p>\n<p><code>RETURNED</code> 是设备轨终态，但只有<strong>码头系统回传 <code>GATE_IN</code> 事件</strong>（通常经 CODECO 或 DCSA <code>GTIN</code>）后才成立。司机口头回报与闸口读数冲突时，应以码头回传为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态机工程实现-事件溯源-幂等与对账\">状态机工程实现：事件溯源、幂等与对账</h2><p>落到代码有三个不可省略的机制。</p>\n<p><strong>其一，事件溯源而非状态覆写。</strong> 每一次状态变化都应存为<strong>不可变事件</strong>（<code>{container_id, event_type, source, occurred_at, received_at, payload_hash}</code>），当前状态是事件流的投影。直接收益是计费可重放、争议可举证——FMC 规则的&quot;账单可核验信息&quot;本质上就是要求系统能回放出&quot;为什么收这笔钱&quot;；若只存最后一帧，费率或日历规则一变，历史账单就无法解释。</p>\n<p><strong>其二，幂等与乱序处理。</strong> 同一个 <code>GATE_OUT</code> 会从码头 EDI、船司 API、司机 App 三个渠道到达且时间戳各异。系统须为每个事件算一个<strong>业务幂等键</strong>（<code>箱号 + 事件类型 + 业务发生时间</code>），并容忍乱序：处理 <code>GATE_IN</code> 时若对应 <code>GATE_OUT</code> 尚未入库，应挂起而非直接推进，等缺口补齐后统一重放。</p>\n<p><strong>其三，对账为常态而非例外。</strong> 信号延迟与语义错配会让内部状态与权威状态周期性漂移，做法是定期拉取权威源做<strong>全量比对</strong>，把差异分三类：可自动修正（时间戳字段）、需人工确认（箱况争议）、需上游澄清（码值语义变化）。<strong>漂移率</strong>本身应作为运营指标——它上升，通常意味着某家承运人的 214 映射表已过期。</p>\n<p>最后，状态机必须与<strong>预约执行</strong>和<strong>成本计费</strong>解耦：它是唯一事实源，预约系统订阅它决定&quot;这箱现在能不能约提箱&quot;，计费系统订阅它起停时钟。任何让下游<strong>直接改写</strong>箱流状态的路径，都会在一月内把状态机污染成不可对账的沼泽。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>箱流是<strong>设备轨（箱号，ISO 6346 锚定）与交易轨（提单/DO，费用锚定）双轨耦合</strong>的状态机，两者不可混为一谈。</li>\n<li><code>AVAILABLE</code> 是卸箱时间与清关放行时间的<strong>较晚者</strong>，必须运行时求值；<code>LFD</code> 由免费天数与营业日历推导，是<strong>装箱维度上的配置实体</strong>。</li>\n<li>滞期费（码头侧）与滞箱费（车队侧）是两条独立计时轨；FMC 2020 年解释性规则要求账单携带可核验证据链，因此状态必须<strong>可重放</strong>。</li>\n<li>上游词汇来自码头 EDI（CODECO/COARRI）、承运人 X12 214/315、DCSA Track &amp; Trace API、监管四路信号，须归一到<strong>刻意收窄的内部状态集</strong>。</li>\n<li>双重运输是把&quot;还空&quot;与&quot;再提空&quot;合并成一次事件的短路跃迁，受<strong>箱主归属</strong>与<strong>还箱窗口</strong>双重守卫。</li>\n<li>实现三支柱：<strong>事件溯源</strong>（可重放计费）、<strong>幂等与乱序挂起</strong>（多源信号收敛）、<strong>常态化对账</strong>（漂移率作为运营指标）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本章后续的<a href=\"../terminal-appointment-window-scheduling/\">码头预约窗口调度</a>与<a href=\"../dispatch-execution-visibility-exception/\">调度执行可视化与异常处理</a>，分别处理状态机的上游输入与实时观测面。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"箱流生命周期与搬移状态模型：从进口放箱到空箱回场的可追踪状态机","id":"箱流生命周期与搬移状态模型-从进口放箱到空箱回场的可追踪状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：设备状态与交易状态的双轨模型","id":"核心概念-设备状态与交易状态的双轨模型"},{"level":2,"text":"状态词汇的标准映射：从 EDI 到 DCSA 事件模型","id":"状态词汇的标准映射-从-edi-到-dcsa-事件模型"},{"level":2,"text":"进口放箱到可提箱：自由期与时点的计算","id":"进口放箱到可提箱-自由期与时点的计算"},{"level":2,"text":"重箱交付与空箱回场：双重运输与还箱约束","id":"重箱交付与空箱回场-双重运输与还箱约束"},{"level":2,"text":"状态机工程实现：事件溯源、幂等与对账","id":"状态机工程实现-事件溯源-幂等与对账"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"短驳网络拓扑与参与方角色：货主、无船承运人、车队、码头与中间人的职责边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/port-drayage-truck-appointment-container-dispatch-system/drayage-network-operating-model/drayage-network-topology-actors"},"next":{"title":"集卡承运商资质、运力池与短驳合同条款的工程化建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/port-drayage-truck-appointment-container-dispatch-system/drayage-network-operating-model/motor-carrier-qualification-contract"}}